SS OBFS URI = ss, example.com, 443, encrypt-method=aes-256-gcm, password="password", obfs=http, obfs-host=cdn.example.com, obfs-uri=/path, udp-relay=false

· ss:plugin-v2ray
! SS V2Ray (ss/tcp) has no surge-mac spelling; skipped.

