! Trojan gRPC (trojan/grpc) cannot be carried by surge-mac; skipped.

· trojan:httpupgrade
! Upgrade (trojan/httpupgrade) cannot be carried by surge-mac; skipped.

· trojan:no-udp
Trojan NoUDP = trojan, example.com, 443, password="password", tls=true, ws=false, sni=example.com, skip-cert-verify=true, udp-relay=false

· trojan:tcp-tls
Trojan = trojan, example.com, 443, password="password", tls=true, ws=false, sni=example.com, skip-cert-verify=false, udp-relay=true

· trojan:ws-tls
Trojan WS = trojan, example.com, 443, password="password", tls=true, ws=true, ws-path=/ws, ws-headers=Host:cdn.example.com, sni=example.com, skip-cert-verify=false, udp-relay=true

· trojan:xray-json-httpupgrade
! Xray Upgrade (trojan/httpupgrade) cannot be carried by surge-mac; skipped.

